<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Disney started with hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Disney started with hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has started coverage of Walt Disney Co with a hold rating, a source at the firm said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock opened up 1/4 to 66-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
